
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Licorne Rouge - Actualité</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ url_for('static', filename='style.css') }}">

    <style>
        .avatar-img {
            width: 45px;
            height: 45px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
            background: #eee;
        }

        .post-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .post-author a {
            color: #222;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .post-author small {
            display: block;
            color: #888;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .post-image {
            width: 100%;
            max-height: 550px;
            object-fit: contain;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-top: 12px;
            background: #f5f5f5;
        }

        .post-content {
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-wrap: anywhere;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }

        .post-stats {
            padding: 12px 0;
            color: #777;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        .post-actions {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 12px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        .post-actions a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #555;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 8px;
            border-radius: 7px;
        }

        .post-actions a:hover {
            background: #f5e7e9;
            color: #d92335;
        }

        .comments {
            padding-top: 10px;
        }

        .comment-item {
            background: #f3f4f6;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin: 8px 0;
            overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        }

        .comment-item strong {
            color: #d92335;
            margin-right: 5px;
        }

        .comment-form {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }

        .comment-form input {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 0;
            padding: 11px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        .comment-form button {
            border: none;
            background: #d92335;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 15px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .composer-heading {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .photo-label {
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .photo-label input {
            max-width: 180px;
        }

        .welcome h2 {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        @media(max-width: 600px) {
            .post-actions a {
                font-size: 13px;
                padding: 6px 3px;
            }

            .comment-form {
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }

            .comment-form button {
                width: 100%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header class="topbar">
    <a href="/" class="brand">🦄 Licorne<span>Rouge</span></a>

    <form action="/search" method="get" class="search">
        <input type="search" name="q"
               placeholder="Rechercher sur Licorne Rouge...">
    </form>

    <nav class="top-actions">
        <a href="/" title="Accueil">🏠</a>
        <a href="/conversations" title="Messages">💬</a>
        <a href="/notifications" title="Notifications">🔔</a>
        <a href="/profile/{{ session.user_id }}" title="Mon profil">👤</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<div class="layout">

    <aside class="sidebar">

        <div class="user-mini">
            {% if current_user and current_user['profile_pic'] %}
                <img class="avatar-img"
                     src="{{ url_for('static', filename='images/' + current_user['profile_pic']) }}"
                     alt="Profil">
            {% else %}
                <div class="avatar">👤</div>
            {% endif %}

            <div>
                <strong>{{ session.username }}</strong>
                <small>Membre de Licorne Rouge</small>
            </div>
        </div>

        <a class="menu-link active" href="/">🏠 Fil d'actualité</a>
        <a class="menu-link" href="/profile/{{ session.user_id }}">👤 Mon profil</a>
        <a class="menu-link" href="/following">🤝 Abonnements</a>
        <a class="menu-link" href="/conversations">💬 Messagerie</a>
        <a class="menu-link" href="/notifications">🔔 Notifications</a>

        <div class="sidebar-title">COMMUNAUTÉ</div>
        <a class="menu-link" href="/groups">👥 Groupes</a>
        <a class="menu-link" href="/pages">🏢 Pages</a>
        <a class="menu-link" href="/marketplace">🛍️ Marketplace</a>

        <div class="sidebar-title">MON COMPTE</div>
        <a class="menu-link logout" href="/logout">🚪 Déconnexion</a>

        <div class="sidebar-footer">
            <strong>Licorne Rouge 🦄</strong>
            <p>Le réseau qui rapproche les Mauritaniens.</p>
            <small>© 2026 Licorne Rouge</small>
        </div>

    </aside>

    <main class="feed">

        <div class="welcome">
            <h2>Bonjour {{ session.username }} 👋</h2>
            <p>Quoi de neuf aujourd'hui en Mauritanie ?</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Création de publication -->
        <section class="composer">

            <div class="composer-heading">
                {% if current_user and current_user['profile_pic'] %}
                    <img class="avatar-img"
                         src="{{ url_for('static', filename='images/' + current_user['profile_pic']) }}"
                         alt="Profil">
                {% else %}
                    <div class="avatar">👤</div>
                {% endif %}

                <strong>{{ session.username }}</strong>
            </div>

            <form action="/create_post" method="post"
                  enctype="multipart/form-data">

                <textarea name="content"
                    placeholder="Quoi de neuf ? Partage avec la communauté..."
                    rows="3"></textarea>

                <div class="composer-bottom">
                    <label class="photo-label">
                        📷 Ajouter une photo
                        <input type="file" name="image" accept="image/*">
                    </label>

                    <button type="submit" class="publish-btn">
                        Publier
                    </button>
                </div>

            </form>
        </section>

        <div class="feed-heading">
            <h3>Fil d'actualité</h3>
            <span>Les dernières publications</span>
        </div>

        {% for post in posts %}

        <article class="post">

            <div class="post-header">

                {% if post['profile_pic'] %}
                    <img class="avatar-img"
                         src="{{ url_for('static', filename='images/' + post['profile_pic']) }}"
                         alt="Photo de {{ post['username'] }}">
                {% else %}
                    <div class="avatar">👤</div>
                {% endif %}

                <div class="post-author">
                    <a href="/profile/{{ post['user_id'] }}">
                        <strong>{{ post['username'] }}</strong>
                    </a>
                    <small>{{ post['date'] }}</small>
                </div>

            </div>

            {% if post['content'] %}
                <p class="post-content">{{ post['content'] }}</p>
            {% endif %}

            {% if post['image'] %}
                <img class="post-image"
                     src="{{ url_for('static', filename='images/' + post['image']) }}"
                     alt="Publication de {{ post['username'] }}">
            {% endif %}

            <div class="post-stats">
                ❤️ {{ post['like_count'] }} J'aime
            </div>

            <div class="post-actions">
                <a href="/like/{{ post['id'] }}">❤️ J'aime</a>
                <a href="#comment-{{ post['id'] }}">💬 Commenter</a>
                <a href="/profile/{{ post['user_id'] }}">👤 Profil</a>
            </div>

            <div class="comments">

                {% for comment in comments %}
                    {% if comment['post_id'] == post['id'] %}

                        <div class="comment-item">
                            <strong>{{ comment['username'] }}</strong>
                            {{ comment['content'] }}
                        </div>

                    {% endif %}
                {% endfor %}

            </div>

            <form id="comment-{{ post['id'] }}"
                  class="comment-form"
                  action="/comment/{{ post['id'] }}"
                  method="post">

                <input type="text" name="content"
                       placeholder="Écrire un commentaire..."
                       required>

                <button type="submit">Envoyer</button>

            </form>

        </article>

        {% else %}

        <div class="empty-feed">
            <div>🌍</div>
            <h3>Bienvenue dans la communauté !</h3>
            <p>Sois le premier à partager une publication.</p>
        </div>

        {% endfor %}

    </main>

    <aside class="rightbar">

        <div class="side-card">
            <h3>🇲🇷 La communauté</h3>
            <p>Bienvenue sur le réseau social des Mauritaniens.</p>
            <p>Partage, découvre et échange avec les autres membres.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="side-card">
            <h3>🌟 Nos espaces</h3>
            <a href="/groups">Découvrir les groupes</a>
            <a href="/pages">Découvrir les pages</a>
            <a href="/marketplace">Voir la Marketplace</a>
        </div>

        <div class="side-card">
            <h3>💡 Notre ambition</h3>
            <p>Rapprocher les personnes, les cultures et les entreprises de Mauritanie.</p>
        </div>

    </aside>

</div>

</body>
</html>
